      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00982",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "一踏入校门，恰巧柏本就走在我的前面。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "As soon as I stepped through the school gate, Kashiwagi happened to be walking ahead of me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00982",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我拽住柏木的胳膊，把他带到路旁，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I grabbed Kashiwagi by the arm and led him to the roadside,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00982",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "向他借了3000元，",
      "en": [
