          "t": "borrowed 3,000 yen from him,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "kinkakuji-p00982",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "并要求他收下佛教辞典和他赠送的尺八，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and asked him to take the Buddhist dictionary and the shakuhachi he had given me,",
          "g": "predicate"
